==English==

===Etymology===
{{borrowing|grc|σκληρός||hard|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪərə|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|sclerae|scleræ}}

# {{label|en|anatomy}} The white of the [[eye]]. It is the tough outer coat of the eye that covers the [[eyeball]] except for the [[cornea]].

